    {
      "id": "ad5c2580b06019a24ee3231a96a9b83d2e7412d095fec3516cd5db1943a849e5",
      "text": "Avoid console.log in MCP servers to prevent client issues. Use a custom logger or `sse` transport for effective logging without protocol interference.",
